## The 4x Advantage: One Platform, Four Content Categories

Most teams pay for multiple tools to cover different content needs. Piktochart eliminates that at one low price:

**1. AI-powered static visual creation**
Infographics, presentations, reports, posters, flyers, social graphics, ebooks, and lead magnets, generated from a prompt or document in under 10 seconds.

