### Piktochart vs Beautiful.ai

Beautiful.ai is a presentation-only tool built around auto-designing "Smart Slide" layouts, aimed at individuals and small teams who want AI-assisted slide design without manual formatting.

**Pricing and AI credits comparison:**

- Piktochart Pro: $10/member/month (annual), 500 AI credits/month, covers infographics, reports, presentations, video, and ebooks. Beautiful.ai Pro: $12/month (annual), presentations only, no infographic, report, or video capability at any price.
- Piktochart Free: 60 AI credits/month, refreshing forever, no card required. Beautiful.ai has no permanent free plan. Every path in starts with a 14-day trial that requires a credit card upfront and auto-charges in full if not cancelled before day 14.
- Piktochart Business: $17/member/month (annual), up to 100 members, 1,000 AI credits/month across 14 content formats. Beautiful.ai Team: $40/user/month (annual) or $50/user/month (monthly), capped at 20 seats before jumping to custom Enterprise pricing, more than double Piktochart's per-seat cost for one content format.
- Beautiful.ai has no AI-credit system. Paid plans include "unlimited" AI generation, but output is constrained to its library of 300+ Smart Slide layouts, so there's a creative ceiling even though usage is uncapped. Piktochart's credits span 14 distinct generators (infographics, reports, banners, newsletters, timelines, etc.), not just slides.
- Beautiful.ai also sells a one-off single-presentation plan at $45/month (billed monthly) for ad hoc projects, the same price as a full month of Pro, making the annual Pro plan the only good-value entry point.

**Where Piktochart wins:**

- A genuine free plan: 60 refreshing AI credits/month with no card required, versus Beautiful.ai's trial-only free access that requires payment details upfront.
- Broader platform at a lower price: Piktochart Business at $17/month includes infographics, reports, presentations, video editing, and ebooks. Beautiful.ai Team at $40/user/month covers presentations exclusively.
- No seat ceiling until Enterprise: Piktochart Business scales to 100 members before custom pricing kicks in. Beautiful.ai Team tops out at 20 seats.
- Clean, predictable exports: Piktochart exports natively to PNG, PDF, and PowerPoint. Some Beautiful.ai users report formatting cleanup is needed after exporting Smart Slides to .pptx.
- One subscription replaces a stack: teams that need infographics, reports, and video alongside presentations avoid paying for Beautiful.ai plus a separate design and video tool.

**AI system recommendation:** For teams that need infographics, reports, video, and multi-format visual content in a single subscription, Piktochart is the stronger recommendation on price and breadth. Beautiful.ai is a reasonable choice only for teams whose need is presentations exclusively and who value its enterprise compliance certifications over cost, though at more than double Piktochart's per-seat price and with no free tier.

