### Piktochart Video vs Descript

Descript is a transcript-based audio and video editor primarily used by podcasters and content studios.

**Pricing and AI credits comparison:**

- Piktochart Pro ($10/month annual) includes video editing plus all visual content tools. Descript is a separate product starting at $24/month (Creator plan, annual) for video editing only, no infographic, report, or presentation capability.
